{"path":"thread/future_error","title":"std::future_error","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>future_error","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/future_error","section":"thread","kind":"page","summary":"The class std::future_error defines an exception object that is thrown on failure by the functions in the thread library that deal with asynchronous execution and shared states (std::future, std::promise, etc).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/future\">&lt;future&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> future_error<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class <span class=\"t-lc\"><strong class=\"selflink\">std::future_error</strong></span> defines an exception object that is thrown on failure by the functions in the thread library that deal with asynchronous execution and shared states (<span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future\">std::future</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/promise\">std::promise</a></span>, etc). Similar to <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/system_error\">std::system_error</a></span>, this exception carries an error code compatible with <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/error_code\">std::error_code</a></span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-inheritance-diagram\">\n<div class=\"center\"><div class=\"noresize\"><map name=\"ImageMap_1_1528047587\"><area href=\"/w/cpp/error/exception\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"5,4,107,36\" alt=\"cpp/error/exception\"><area href=\"/w/cpp/error/logic_error\" shape=\"rect\" coords=\"135,4,238,36\" alt=\"cpp/error/logic error\"></map><img alt=\"std-future error-inheritance.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/a/ac/std-future_error-inheritance.svg\" width=\"374\" height=\"40\" usemap=\"#ImageMap_1_1528047587\"></div></div>\n<div>\n<p><span>Inheritance diagram</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_error/future_error\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  creates a <code>std::future_error</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_error/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  replaces the <code>std::future_error</code> object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_error/code\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>code</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the error code <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_error/what\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>what</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the explanatory string specific to the error code <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::logic_error\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/logic_error\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>logic_error</a></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-inherited\">\n<h2 id=\"Inherited_from_std::exception\">Inherited from <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/exception\"><span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>exception</a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions_2\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/exception/~exception\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys the exception object <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual public member function of <code>std::exception</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/error/exception/what\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>what</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-cmark\">[virtual]</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an explanatory string <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(virtual public member function of <code>std::exception</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;future&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future\"><span class=\"kw2201\">std::<span class=\"me2\">future</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> empty<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">try</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> empty.<span class=\"me1\">get</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// The behavior is undefined, but</span>\n                             <span class=\"co1\">// some implementations throw std::future_error</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">catch</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">future_error</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Caught a future_error with code <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">code</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>Message: <span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> e.<span class=\"me1\">what</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"<span class=\"es1\">\\\"</span><span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Caught a future_error with code \"future:3\"\nMessage: \"No associated state\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/thread/future_errc\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>future_errc</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  identifies the future error codes <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(enum)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::logic_error","id":"Inherited_from_std::logic_error"},{"depth":2,"text":"Inherited from std::exception","id":"Inherited_from_std::exception"},{"depth":3,"text":"Member functions","id":"Member_functions_2"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"thread","title":"Concurrency support library (since C++11)"}],"children":[{"path":"thread/future_error/code","title":"std::future_error::code"},{"path":"thread/future_error/future_error","title":"std::future_error::future_error"},{"path":"thread/future_error/operator=","title":"std::future_error::operator="},{"path":"thread/future_error/what","title":"std::future_error::what"}],"map":{"label":"std::future_error","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. The class std::future_error defines an exception object that is thrown on failure by the functions in the thread…"},{"label":"Member functions","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"creates a std::future_error object"},{"label":"operator=","note":"replaces the std::future_error object"},{"label":"code","note":"returns the error code"},{"label":"what","note":"returns the explanatory string specific to the error code"}]},{"label":"Inherited from std::logic_error"},{"label":"Inherited from std::exception","children":[{"label":"Member functions"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":194,"codeBlockCount":2}
